# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:6
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_ebd278f3:

    # "Man..."
    "唉……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:7
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_75a8ab85:

    # "It looks like no one wants to be bothered today."
    "看来今天谁都不想被打扰。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:8
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_a3dd5dba:

    # "I slump down into the nearest desk."
    "我一屁股瘫进最近的课桌里。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:9
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_140dc341:

    # "How am I supposed to occupy myself with something literature-related by myself like this?"
    "就我一个人，怎么让自己忙点跟文学有关的事啊？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:10
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_b96163c6:

    # "I guess I could always read some of the book Yuri gave me..."
    "我倒是可以读读优里给我的那本书……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:11
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_c6d56ac0:

    # "...But I'm feeling a little too tired to read."
    "……但我现在累得不太想看书。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:12
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_c374df0f:

    # "I could probably fall asleep right now."
    "我现在大概马上就能睡着。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:13
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_70925125:

    # "I close my eyes and end up listening in on Sayori's conversation with Monika."
    "我闭上眼睛，不知不觉听起了纱世里和莫妮卡的对话。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:15
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_09fc8625:

    # s "We're probably gonna seem really lame compared to all the other clubs, though..."
    s "不过跟其他社团比起来，我们可能显得特别没意思……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:17
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_6d1d2d28:

    # m "Hmm..."
    m "嗯……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:18
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_10dbd395:

    # m 2b "Well, we can't give up."
    m 2b "好吧，我们不能放弃。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:19
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_8920eea6:

    # m "The festival is our chance to show everyone what literature is all about!"
    m "文化祭就是我们向所有人展示文学魅力的机会！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:20
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_ebb868c8:

    # m 2d "The problem is that the idea of a literature club sounds too dense and intellectual..."
    m 2d "问题是，文学社听起来太沉闷、太学术了……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:21
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_9bd0888b:

    # m "But it's not like that at all, you know?"
    m "但根本不是那样的，你知道吗？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:22
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_82578239:

    # m 2a "We just need a way of showing that to everyone..."
    m 2a "我们只是需要一种方式，把这一点展现给大家……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:23
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_3384cee9:

    # m "Something that speaks to their creative minds."
    m "一种能打动他们创作心灵的东西。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:26
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_607ebf69:

    # s 1i "Mmmmmmmmmmm....."
    s 1i "嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯嗯……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:27
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_95130e53:

    # s "That doesn't solve the problem, though!"
    s "但那也解决不了问题啊！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:30
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_037a4dfd:

    # m 2d "Eh? What do you mean?"
    m 2d "诶？什么意思？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:33
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_9111b144:

    # s 1c "Even if we come up with the most fun thing ever..."
    s 1c "就算我们想出史上最有趣的点子……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:34
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_2f7dad10:

    # s "Nobody will come in the first place if it's a literature event."
    s "只要是文学活动，一开始就不会有人来。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:35
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_64881939:

    # s "So it's more important to figure out how to get people to show up in the first place, you know?"
    s "所以更重要的是，先想办法让人愿意来，你知道吗？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:36
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_51184aa2:

    # s 1a "And after they come, we can do the thing to speak to their creative minds."
    s 1a "等他们来了，我们再做打动创作心灵的事。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:37
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_14278efc:

    # "...What's this?"
    "……这是怎么回事？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:38
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_55b7d1b5:

    # "Sayori is taking this really seriously."
    "纱世里居然这么认真。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:39
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_7dcbbe2f:

    # "It's rare to hear her deliberating like this."
    "很少听到她这样深思熟虑。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:42
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_821bebf6:

    # m 2a "Huh, that's a good point..."
    m 2a "嗯，有道理……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:43
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_5a567997:

    # m "In that case, do you think food will do the trick?"
    m "那样的话，你觉得用吃的行不行？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:46
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_4e085cf3:

    # s 1n "W-What kind?!"
    s 1n "什、什么吃的？！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:49
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_e67c3d03:

    # m 2b "Ah... Well, I guess we could--"
    m 2b "啊……嗯，我想我们可以——"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:52
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_47b1e3cd:

    # s "Cupcakes!"
    s "纸杯蛋糕！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:55
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_2f575b47:

    # m "Ahaha. Good thinking."
    m "啊哈哈。好主意。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:56
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_52375000:

    # m 1a "Natsuki would love to do that."
    m 1a "夏树肯定乐意做这个。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:59
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_5f170b21:

    # s 4x "Ah! You're right!"
    s 4x "啊！你说得对！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:60
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_1589bf64:

    # s "Natsuki makes the best cupcakes!"
    s "夏树做的纸杯蛋糕最好吃了！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:61
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_8824af48:

    # s "That works out perfectly~"
    s "简直完美~"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:64
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_0633c181:

    # m 1d "That wasn't why you suggested it...?"
    m 1d "你提议那个，不是因为那个原因吗……？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:67
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_f27be215:

    # s 4q "Cupcakes speak to my creative tummy~"
    s 4q "纸杯蛋糕能打动我的创作胃~"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:70
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_a01fa8fe:

    # m 1l "..."
    m 1l "……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:71
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_f6310840:

    # m "Cupcakes it is, then."
    m "那就这么定了，纸杯蛋糕。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:74
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_38cfa41d:

    # s 1g "I'm hungry..."
    s 1g "我饿了……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:77
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_bd7ee0bf:

    # m 1a "Anyway, we still need to work out the details of the event itself..."
    m 1a "总之，活动的具体细节还得再琢磨琢磨……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:80
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_383b3fe0:

    # "I find myself smiling."
    "我不由自主地笑了。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:81
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_62cb7948:

    # "In the end, Sayori is still her usual self."
    "说到底，纱世里还是老样子。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:82
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_467d437c:

    # "But therein lies the unexpected reason I admire her."
    "但正因如此，她才有让我佩服的理由。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:83
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_43defa01:

    # "Unlike me, who has trouble finding any motivation at all..."
    "不像我，连找点动力都费劲……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:84
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_756297ea:

    # "Sayori can put her mind to things and make them come to life."
    "纱世里能全神贯注地做事，把它们变成现实。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:85
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_4e902aa7:

    # "I suppose that's why I end up letting her get on my case about things."
    "我想，这就是为什么我最后总是任由她说教我。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:86
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_1c49757d:

    # "I can't help but wonder what it would be like to see the world through her eyes..."
    "我忍不住好奇，用她的眼睛看世界会是什么样子……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:90
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_54a76a80:

    # mc "Uwaa--!"
    mc "哇啊——！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:91
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_023cfb54:

    # "I open my eyes to find Sayori's face filling my vision."
    "我睁开眼，纱世里的脸占满了我的视野。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:92
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_23680e41:

    # "I nearly fall out of my chair."
    "我差点从椅子上摔下去。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:94
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_e69f2726:

    # s 4q "Ehehe, sorry~"
    s 4q "诶嘿嘿，抱歉~"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:95
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_02f1b11d:

    # s 4i "Wait!"
    s 4i "等等！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:96
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_62d4f5b3:

    # s 1j "Actually, I'm not sorry at all!"
    s 1j "其实，我一点都不抱歉！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:97
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_c56a577b:

    # s "It's your fault for sleeping like that!"
    s "谁让你睡觉睡得那么难看！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:98
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_dcb0fc40:

    # s "This isn't the napping club!"
    s "这里可不是午睡社！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:99
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_7d7d37ba:

    # mc "Does our school have a napping club...?"
    mc "我们学校有午睡社吗……？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:100
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_4b3db410:

    # s 1h "You're staying up late again, aren't you?"
    s 1h "你昨晚又熬夜了吧？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:101
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_1d7ac73a:

    # s "Now that you're in a club, you're gonna have less time for anime, you know!"
    s "现在你进了社团，看动画的时间就更少了，知道吧！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:102
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_5214e4eb:

    # s "You'll need to get used to it!"
    s "你得早点习惯才行！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:103
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_1eee5de8:

    # mc "Don't say that so loud...!"
    mc "别那么大声说啊……！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:104
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_18e51069:

    # "I glance over my shoulder to see if Monika overheard."
    "我回头瞥了一眼，看莫妮卡有没有听到。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:105
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_f99f8ce0:

    # s 1g "It's true, though..."
    s 1g "不过她说得没错……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:106
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "是啊……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:107
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_6f1767e0:

    # mc "I know, I know."
    mc "我知道啦。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:108
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_c99f2adc:

    # mc "You're always looking out for me, Sayori."
    mc "你总是为我着想，纱世里。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:109
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_e688cc67:

    # s 4q "Ehehe~"
    s 4q "诶嘿嘿~"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:110
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_f3388382:

    # s "It's what I do best!"
    s "这可是我的专长！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:111
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_8ac2b061:

    # mc "...That's a problem!"
    mc "……那就有问题了！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:112
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_4db03926:

    # mc "What about you?"
    mc "你呢？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:113
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_3e38066e:

    # mc "You look out for me better than you look out for yourself."
    mc "你照顾我，比照顾自己还上心。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:114
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_7f241ab9:

    # mc "You're still oversleeping every day, aren't you?"
    mc "你不是每天都睡过头吗？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:115
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_4512d6c1:

    # s 1l "Eh?"
    s 1l "诶？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:116
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_6a695de0:

    # s "N-Not every day!"
    s "才、才不是每天！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:117
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_60d030b6:

    # mc "That's not very convincing..."
    mc "这话可没什么说服力……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:118
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_8f1c24ad:

    # mc "How many days this past week have you gotten up on time?"
    mc "这一周你有几天按时起床了？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:119
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_30451397:

    # s 1m "That's..."
    s 1m "那是……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:120
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_a5d16478:

    # s 1o "...It's a secret!"
    s 1o "……秘密！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:121
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_8c3318a5:

    # mc "I knew it..."
    mc "我就知道……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:122
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_8793bcb9:

    # s 5a "C'monnnn!"
    s 5a "哎呀呀呀！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:123
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_6803c906:

    # s "At least give me the benefit of the doubt..."
    s "至少别把我往坏处想嘛……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:124
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_d086a905:

    # mc "I can't even do that."
    mc "那我还真做不到。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:125
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_1fb2352a:

    # mc "Look, Sayori, it's written all over you."
    mc "你看，纱世里，你浑身上下都写着呢。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:126
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_2e7893cd:

    # s 1b "Eh...?"
    s 1b "诶……？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:127
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_c3e7bdce:

    # "Sayori glances around at herself."
    "纱世里低头看了看自己。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:128
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_e032ee06:

    # s "How is it written all over me?"
    s "怎么个浑身上下都写着？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:129
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_85ddd496:

    # mc "You were clearly in a rush this morning..."
    mc "你今早明显是赶时间……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:130
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_442e54ad:

    # mc "Look, your hair is sticking out all around here."
    mc "你看，你这边头发都翘出来了。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:132
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_f57f6de7:

    # s 1e "Ah--"
    s 1e "啊——"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:133
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_8bb7c20a:

    # "I run my fingertips down the side of Sayori's hair, trying to straighten it out."
    "我用指尖顺着纱世里的头发捋下去，想把它抚平。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:134
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_71887ffc:

    # mc "Man, you really need a brush for this..."
    mc "天哪，你这样真的需要一把梳子……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:135
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_d61f01c7:

    # s 1y "My hair is just really hard to get right..."
    s 1y "我的头发就是很难弄好嘛……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:136
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_c375aed4:

    # mc "I won't fall for that."
    mc "我才不信。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:137
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_6eed6851:

    # mc "There's more than just your hair."
    mc "不只是头发。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:138
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_1c664c25:

    # mc "Look, your bow isn't straight, either."
    mc "你看，你的蝴蝶结也没系正。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:139
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_f67e2522:

    # mc "And there's a toothpaste stain on your collar right here."
    mc "还有这儿，衣领上有块牙膏渍。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:140
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_d975f34f:

    # "I try to wipe off the stain with my finger."
    "我试着用手指把污渍擦掉。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:142
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_4c981d96:

    # s "B-But nobody would ever notice that..."
    s "可、可没人会注意到那些吧……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:143
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_c21e6c0b:

    # mc "Of course they would."
    mc "当然会有人注意到。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:144
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_6bbbe8c8:

    # mc "Nobody's gonna tell you about it because they don't want to embarrass you."
    mc "没人告诉你，只是因为他们不想让你难堪。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:145
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_b1102581:

    # mc "Fortunately, I really don't care about that."
    mc "幸好，我完全不在乎这个。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:146
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_6b261d64:

    # s 5c "Hey, you meanie..."
    s 5c "喂，你这个坏人……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:147
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_9d2ccf73:

    # mc "And you don't even keep your blazer buttoned up."
    mc "而且你连外套扣子都不扣。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:148
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_7088cb16:

    # mc "Seriously, Sayori..."
    mc "说真的，纱世里……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:149
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_c3daf6f0:

    # mc "Why do you think you don't have a boyfriend yet?"
    mc "你觉得你为什么还没有男朋友？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:151
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_3cd77e3d:

    # s "Eh??"
    s "诶？？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:152
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_66638312:

    # s "That's {i}super{/i} mean!"
    s "这也{i}太{/i}过分了吧！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:153
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_0bd0c01c:

    # mc "Sorry, but you'll thank me later..."
    mc "抱歉，但你以后会感谢我的……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:154
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_192cdae5:

    # "I start to button her blazer from the bottom."
    "我从最下面的扣子开始，给她扣外套。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:155
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_b05e7ba0:

    # mc "Once you see how much better it looks, you'll change your mind."
    mc "等你看它有多好看了，就会改变想法了。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:160
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_1_c98e38ed:

