translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_b153374a:

    # s "And I would start crying really hard."
    s "然后我就嚎啕大哭。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:456
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_fc5de902:

    # s "Ahaha!"
    s "啊哈哈！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:457
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_8d3c6891:

    # s "And you would rush over as quick as you could."
    s "而你总会用最快的速度冲过来。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:459
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_538f8ebe:

    # s "You would try really hard to get me to stop crying."
    s "你会拼命想办法让我别哭。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:460
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_fb6182dd:

    # s "It was almost like you blamed yourself and were afraid of getting in trouble if someone found out..."
    s "那样子简直像是在自责，害怕被别人发现后会挨骂……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:461
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_4e4e18ef:

    # s "Even though it really wasn't your fault at all, you know?"
    s "明明根本不是你的错，你知道吗？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:462
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_0b40f342:

    # mc "Did I really do that...?"
    mc "我真的做过那种事吗……？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:463
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_6aaa6b13:

    # s "Yeah...you don't remember?"
    s "嗯……你不记得了？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:464
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_a25340ed:

    # mc "Come to think of it, maybe I do remember a bit..."
    mc "说起来，我好像确实有点印象……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:465
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_b2c73dc7:

    # mc "I guess I was always so focused on my games that I didn't pay enough attention to you."
    mc "我想我以前总是太沉迷于自己的游戏，没怎么顾得上你。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:466
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_8ba352b0:

    # mc "So in a way, it was my fault."
    mc "所以从某种意义上说，那是我的错。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:467
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_94693cef:

    # mc "Kind of like this time, too..."
    mc "就像这次一样……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:468
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_f546ba9c:

    # mc "If I wasn't rushing you out of the closet, you probably wouldn't have hit your head."
    mc "要不是我催你快点出储物柜，你大概也不会撞到头。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:469
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_23d81314_1:

    # s "[player]..."
    s "[player]……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:470
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_9f2f68b4:

    # s "I don't think you realize it, but you're always thinking about other people."
    s "你可能没意识到，但你总是在为别人着想。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:471
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_9f14e418:

    # s "Even after all these years..."
    s "这么多年过去了……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:472
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_94254a75:

    # s "You're rushing to help me, even though I'm just being clumsy."
    s "明明是我自己笨手笨脚，你却还是急着来帮我。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:474
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_f6a70330:

    # s "You're really a sweetheart..."
    s "你真是个好人……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:475
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_c83dc539:

    # mc "D-Don't call me that!"
    mc "别、别这么叫我！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:476
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_3947a85e:

    # mc "And I don't really do this kind of thing all the time..."
    mc "而且我也不是经常做这种事……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:477
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_f3b701ba:

    # mc "I guess when it comes to you, it just feels natural."
    mc "我想，只有对你的时候，做这些才显得那么自然。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:478
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_a24cb8db:

    # mc "Before I even know it, I'm treating you like that."
    mc "等我回过神来，就已经在那样照顾你了。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:479
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_6b862d7d:

    # mc "I guess that's what happens when you've been friends for so long."
    mc "我想这就是做这么多年朋友的结果吧。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:481
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_9f4c69bc:

    # s "Really...?"
    s "真的吗……？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:482
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_aceff536:

    # s "Maybe you're right..."
    s "也许你说得对……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:483
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_23d81314_2:

    # s "[player]..."
    s "[player]……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:484
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_de28276d:

    # s "I'm so glad that nothing's changed between us."
    s "我好高兴，我们之间什么都没变。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:485
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_d0478868:

    # s "Do you think it'll be like this forever?"
    s "你觉得会永远这样下去吗？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:486
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_c3eb8a5f:

    # mc "Forever...?"
    mc "永远……？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:487
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_84a398b9:

    # "If I'm honest to myself..."
    "如果诚实地面对自己……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:488
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_4f62e153:

    # "There's no telling where we'll each end up for college, or after that."
    "谁也说不好我们将来会上哪所大学，之后又各奔东西。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:489
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_5750840d:

    # "So it wouldn't be fair for me to make any promises."
    "所以让我做任何承诺，都不太公平。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:490
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_bf0874e3:

    # "But..."
    "但是……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:491
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_32da8be5:

    # mc "Well, I hope so."
    mc "嗯，我希望如此。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:492
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_d0bf2071:

    # mc "It's been this long already, right?"
    mc "毕竟已经这么多年了，对吧？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:493
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_2f2b523a:

    # mc "I can't imagine you ever changing, so my hopes are up."
    mc "我想象不出你会有什么变化，所以我满怀期待。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:494
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_7c28ceed:

    # s "I'm so happy..."
    s "我好开心……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:495
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_dd608be3:

    # "Sayori has a whimsical expression in her eyes."
    "纱世里的眼里带着梦幻般的神情。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:496
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_592bb0c1:

    # "We remain silent for a moment."
    "我们沉默了一会儿。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:497
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_afced0ef:

    # "She's so silly and clumsy on the outside that when I see her deep in thought like this..."
    "她平时那么冒冒失失的，可当她像这样陷入沉思的时候……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:498
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_b2985e6c:

    # "It makes me not want to disturb her."
    "反而让我不忍心打扰她。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:499
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_e34b90af:

    # s "I guess we should go back..."
    s "我们该回去了吧……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:500
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_5c870fd0:

    # s "I don't want to worry Monika, you know?"
    s "我可不想让莫妮卡担心，你知道吗？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:501
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_32472eec:

    # mc "Good luck with that."
    mc "那你自求多福吧。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:502
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_03477bd7:

    # mc "She's gonna see your forehead either way."
    mc "她反正会看到你额头的。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:503
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_dd3c98d4:

    # s "Not if I hide it under my bangs~"
    s "我用刘海挡住就看不到啦~"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:508
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_723967cd:

    # "Sayori hops to her feet."
    "纱世里跳了起来。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:510
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_5c3181d9:

    # s "A-Aaahh--!"
    s "啊、啊啊——！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:511
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_0ea983ff:

    # "She clutches her forehead again."
    "她又捂住了额头。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:512
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_c27fc0da:

    # mc "Don't stand up so fast after hurting yourself!"
    mc "受了伤就别起得那么快！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:513
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_772b7720:

    # s "Uuuu..."
    s "呜呜……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:514
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_d61cd406:

    # mc "Well, I guess it's too late now..."
    mc "好吧，现在说什么都晚了……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:515
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_ab004c1f:

    # mc "Anyway, let's go."
    mc "总之，走吧。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:518
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_272a0f53:

    # "I follow Sayori out of the classroom."
    "我跟在纱世里后面走出教室。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:519
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_ab1fd0d2:

    # "Sayori plays with her bangs to try to hide the bump, but without much success."
    "纱世里摆弄着刘海想遮住那个包，但不太成功。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:520
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_0c55e269:

    # "In a moment, we make it back to the clubroom."
    "不一会儿，我们回到了部室。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:526
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_25f9f91b:

    # m "Ah, you're back!"
    m "啊，你们回来啦！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:527
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_d67d39ac:

    # m "Good timing, I was just about ready to start with sharing our poems."
    m "来得正好，我正要开始分享诗歌呢。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:528
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_62a8336a:

    # m 1d "Eh? Sayori, your forehead..."
    m 1d "诶？纱世里，你的额头……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:530
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_f3d25d58:

    # mc "She's fine, don't worry about--"
    mc "她没事，不用担心——"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:532
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_6c376380:

    # s "I was playing with the crayons and smacked my forehead into the shelf!"
    s "我玩蜡笔的时候，额头撞到书架上了！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:534
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:536
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:537
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_13e59773:

    # m 3l "...Well, anyway!"
    m 3l "……好了，不说这个！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:538
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_30129c4d:

    # m 1a "Were you able to find everything we needed?"
    m 1a "我们要找的东西都找到了吗？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:541
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_464e4b1d:

    # s "Uh-huh! I have it right--"
    s "嗯哼！都在这——"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:542
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_bf069d85:

    # s 1n "...Eh?"
    s 1n "……诶？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:543
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_134b9320:

    # "Sayori frantically glances around herself."
    "纱世里慌张地在自己身上翻找。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:545
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_2829fbdb:

    # s "I...forgot all of the stuff!!"
    s "我……把东西全忘在那儿了！！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:547
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_da2075e7:

    # mc "Calm down, Sayori."
    mc "冷静点，纱世里。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:548
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_12353a31:

    # mc "I have it all right here."
    mc "都在我这儿呢。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:549
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_51155624:

    # mc "I found the poster paper, too."
    mc "海报用纸我也找到了。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:552
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈哈！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:553
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_4a72d8e0:

    # m "Sounds like you ended up doing all the work, [player]."
    m "听起来活儿都是你干的呢，[player]。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:555
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_c322804d:

    # mc "Ah, well, Sayori--"
    mc "啊，那个，纱世里——"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:556
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_2295a512:

    # "I fail to come up with an excuse for Sayori."
    "我一时想不出怎么给纱世里开脱。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:558
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_f60f0a2a:

    # s "I made it an adventure!"
    s "我把它变成了一场冒险！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:560
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_cb79e6c0:

    # mc "...Yeah, that."
    mc "……嗯，对，就是这样。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:562
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_41b5dc26:

    # m "Ahaha, okay, okay."
    m "啊哈哈，好好好。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:563
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_ccb28dcf:

    # m 1a "In any case, good work!"
    m 1a "总之，干得好！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:564
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_201a0e97:

    # m "I'll start working on the posters tonight."
    m "我今晚就开始做海报。"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:567
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_207bcd32:

    # s "Me too!"
    s "我也是！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:571
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_6234334a:

    # m 4b "...Okay, everyone!"
    m 4b "……好了，各位！"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:572
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_20dbe677:

    # m "Are you ready to share your poems?"
    m "准备好分享你们的诗了吗？"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:573
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_728dbcca:

    # mc "Guess I should grab mine..."
    mc "看来我也该去拿我的诗了……"

# script-exclusives-sayori.rpyc:574
translate chinese sayori_exclusive_2_3d059004:

    # "After making sure the crayon box is closed tightly, I return to my seat."
    "确认蜡笔盒盖好后，我回到了座位上。"

